&lt;li&gt;Health insurance for you and your dependents &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions toward retirement &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid annual leave and sick leave, in addition to public holidays &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two paid, week-long organization-wide breaks at mid-year and end-of-year &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and home office setup benefits &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up-to-date computer equipment&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
