&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our average process takes around 2-3 weeks but we will always work around your availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
