&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Business Apps IT is a team of product enthusiasts and data engineers that focuses on developing best-in class composable AI solutions in the domain of System Transformations (migrations such as SAP ECC to S/4, introduction of new software, system landscape consolidation, etc.). Business Apps are purpose-built solutions created for a specific line of business, addressing most impactful pain points in their respective domain. The solutions are best practice examples of how Celonis is used in new, innovative ways that push the boundaries of our platform. The team has a great balance of technical skills to build solutions paired with a customer focus and product management mindset to create meaningful products widely adopted across our customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hybrid between a product manager and an engineer. Someone who can sit with a customer, understand a transformation pain point, and then go design and build the solution together with the rest of the team rather than handing it off. You&#39;ll operate in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment where shipping quickly matters more than perfect process, and where the line between &quot;designing the product&quot; and &quot;building the product&quot; is intentionally blurry. You get hands-on: prototyping on the platform, wiring up data, composing AI-driven applications, and iterating directly with the people who&#39;ll use them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be at the frontier of how Celonis reimagines enterprise system transformation. Turning a bold vision into working products that customers adopt. If you&#39;re energized by owning something end-to-end, moving fast, and being measured by what you ship rather than what you spec, this is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to make the vision of AI powered system transformation a reality. Building products that turn the cutting edge capabilities of the Celonis Process Intelligence platform from strategy into solutions customers run on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and ship purpose-built but flexible solutions that span the full enterprise modernization journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the most cutting-edge capabilities of the Celonis platform and compose them into coherent, deployable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with frontier AI development tools that plug natively into the platform, using them to accelerate how you build, enrich, and deploy solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move fluidly between customer, prototype, and production: discover the pain point, build the thing, put it in front of users, and iterate fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive all steps within the product development lifecycle from ideation to product development to scaling solutions across all Celonis customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with platform product managers, engineers and partners to influence the underlying Celonis capabilities your solutions depend on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with GTM, UX, and customers to ensure what you build actually gets adopted and scales across the customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about system transformations, the Celonis technology, and what it can do for our customers, here&#39;s your chance to directly contribute to taking our EMS to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 - 7 years of experience as a product engineer, technical product manager, founding/forward-deployed engineer, functional consultant or comparable hybrid builder role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building coherent product offerings, not just isolated features. You think in terms of the whole solution and how the pieces fit together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical and tech-savvy: comfortable in data (SQL, PQL, Python, MCP, Agents), able to prototype and build, and quick to pick up new tools and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferrably, demonstrated knowledge in SAP system composition (functional and/or SAP base)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of what it means to modernize applications and whole enterprise system landscapes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of enterprise architecture (system landscapes, capabilities, integrations) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in ambiguity with an entrepreneurial mindset. Self-directed, biased toward action, and able to make progress without a fully defined roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the willingness to work very closely with customers and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good knowledge of spoken and written English (German is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;f you have any questions regarding the role please get in touch with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
